BT /F2 11 Tf 0.118 0.161 0.231 rg 62 730 Td (3. Machine Learning Models: Architecture & Mathematical Formulation) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.200 0.255 0.333 rg 54 710 Td (The C2 learning architecture operates on a decoupled, two-tier formulation:) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.059 0.090 0.165 rg 54 694.0 Td (Tier 1: Context-Only Neural Response Encoder \(models/model.py\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.200 0.255 0.333 rg 54 680.0 Td (Role: Maps a 9-dimensional student context vector into a 16-dimensional latent cognitive representation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.200 0.255 0.333 rg 54 668.0 Td (Input Features \(dim=9\):) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.200 0.255 0.333 rg 64 656.0 Td (  1. skill_estimate: Latent ability estimate [0, 1]              2. recent_success_rate: Moving average of recent attempts) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.200 0.255 0.333 rg 64 644.0 Td (  3. recent_independent_rate: Unassisted completion ratio       4. hint_frequency: Average hints per recent task) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.200 0.255 0.333 rg 64 632.0 Td (  5. c3_risk_value: Frustration/distress score \(conf-weighted\)   6. c3_confidence: Reliability score of sensor) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.200 0.255 0.333 rg 64 620.0 Td (  7. c3_is_known: 1.0 if sensor is fresh, 0.0 otherwise          8. c3_is_missing: 1.0 if expired/absent, 0.0 otherwise) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.200 0.255 0.333 rg 64 608.0 Td (  9. consecutive_failures: Consecutive unsuccessful attempts streak) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.200 0.255 0.333 rg 54 596.0 Td (Architecture: Input \(9\) -> FC\(32\) -> ReLU -> FC\(16\) -> ReLU -> Latent Context phi\(s\) in R^16) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.200 0.255 0.333 rg 54 584.0 Td (Loss Function: Binary Cross-Entropy on observed action outcome y in {0, 1}:) Tj ET
BT /F4 8.5 Tf 0.200 0.255 0.333 rg 74 572.0 Td (  L_BCE = - [ y * log\(sigma\(z_a\)\) + \(1 - y\) * log\(1 - sigma\(z_a\)\) ]) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.200 0.255 0.333 rg 54 560.0 Td (Training Performance: Accuracy: 70.6% | Validation BCE: 0.5969 | Expected Calibration Error \(ECE\): 0.0333) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.059 0.090 0.165 rg 54 544.0 Td (Tier 2: Bayesian Linear Action Heads & Thompson Sampling \(policy/policy.py\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.200 0.255 0.333 rg 54 530.0 Td (Role: Estimates bounded expected reward r_a approx w_a^T x for each action variant, where x = [1.0, phi\(s\)] in R^17.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.200 0.255 0.333 rg 54 518.0 Td (Number of Heads: 4 distinct heads \(easy_visual, easy_text, medium_visual, medium_text\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.200 0.255 0.333 rg 54 506.0 Td (Conjugate Prior: w_a ~ Normal\(m_0, S_0^-1\) where m_0 = 0 in R^17 and S_0 = 10 * I_17. Observation noise sigma^2 = 1.0.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.200 0.255 0.333 rg 54 494.0 Td (Online Recursive Bayesian Update: For executed action a* upon observing reward r:) Tj ET
BT /F4 8.5 Tf 0.200 0.255 0.333 rg 74 482.0 Td (  S_a* <- S_a* + \(1/sigma^2\) * x * x^T           m_a* <- S_a*^-1 * \( \(1/sigma^2\) * sum\(x * r\) \)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.200 0.255 0.333 rg 54 470.0 Td (Action Selection \(Masked Thompson Sampling\):) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.200 0.255 0.333 rg 64 458.0 Td (  1. Filter allowed actions: Eligible = Allowed INTERSECT \(consecutive_failures < max_failure_sequence\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.200 0.255 0.333 rg 64 446.0 Td (  2. If Eligible is empty: output action_id = null \(triggers teacher 1-on-1 intervention\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.200 0.255 0.333 rg 64 434.0 Td (  3. For each a in Eligible: sample w_tilde_a ~ Normal\(m_a, S_a^-1\) and score r_tilde_a = w_tilde_a^T x) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.200 0.255 0.333 rg 64 422.0 Td (  4. Pick action: a* = argmax_{a in Eligible} \(r_tilde_a\)) Tj ET
