BT /F2 11 Tf 0.118 0.161 0.231 rg 62 400.0 Td (4. Bounded Reward Formula & Safeguard Rules) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.200 0.255 0.333 rg 54 380.0 Td (The reward formula is frozen in models/config.json:) Tj ET
BT /F4 8.5 Tf 0.200 0.255 0.333 rg 64 368.0 Td (  reward = clip\( 0.70 * task_success + 0.30 * independent_completion - hint_penalty - distress_penalty, -1.0, 1.0 \)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.200 0.255 0.333 rg 54 356.0 Td (  - hint_penalty = 0.05 * min\(hints_used, 4\)      - distress_penalty = 0.30 if affective stress detected) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.200 0.255 0.333 rg 54 344.0 Td (  - Break Rule: Confirmed break BYPASSES C2 selection entirely. No penalty \(reward = 0.00\), no posterior update.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.200 0.255 0.333 rg 54 332.0 Td (  - Signal Expiry: If C3 expires_at <= decision_time, signal status is UNKNOWN. Missing risk is NEVER assumed to be 0.) Tj ET
